  ^{:line 46} [^{:val 1} pollErrClosing 1] ; descriptor is closed
  ^{:line 47} [^{:val 2} pollErrTimeout 2] ; I/O timeout
  ^{:line 48} [^{:val 3} pollErrNotPollable 3]) ; general error polling descriptor















(go/const "pollDesc contains 2 binary semaphores, rg and wg, to park reader and writer\ngoroutines respectively. The semaphore can be in the following states:\n\n\tpdReady - io readiness notification is pending;\n\t          a goroutine consumes the notification by changing the state to pdNil.\n\tpdWait - a goroutine prepares to park on the semaphore, but not yet parked;\n\t         the goroutine commits to park by changing the state to G pointer,\n\t         or, alternatively, concurrent io notification changes the state to pdReady,\n\t         or, alternatively, concurrent timeout/close changes the state to pdNil.\n\tG pointer - the goroutine is blocked on the semaphore;\n\t            io notification or timeout/close changes the state to pdReady or pdNil respectively\n\t            and unparks the goroutine.\n\tpdNil - none of the above.\n"
  ^{:line 65} [^{:tag uintptr :val 0} pdNil 0]
  ^{:line 66} [^{:tag uintptr :val 1} pdReady 1]
  ^{:line 67} [^{:tag uintptr :val 2} pdWait 2])


